From 9af22397020ddfeb526c1eff5a7a5ad2559b5689 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <EscapeA@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 18:54:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(chat): show session-lifetime token consumption in input
 composer
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add '已用 X' label next to context usage in ChatInput — real API usage
totals (input+output+cache_read+cache_write) from session_usage table,
refreshed every 15s. Hover/click shows multi-line breakdown (input/output/
cache read/cache write/reasoning).

- server: getUsageTotals() sums usage_scope='model_call' rows;
  /api/hermes/sessions/:id/usage?scope=total returns camelCase totals
- client: fetchSessionUsageTotal() + 15s polling in ChatInput
- i18n: chat.sessionTokensUsed / chat.sessionTokensDetail (10 locales)
- NPopover: hover on desktop, click on mobile; plain-text style matches
  existing context usage
